==================== Input ====================
<p i18n>  Hello   <b>world</b>
  {count, plural, =0 {none} other {many}}  </p>
<div><p i18n="@@id" class="aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" title="bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb">  Hello  </p></div>
<span i18n>x</span>   <b>y</b>
<p i18n></p>
<p i18n-title title="a">  not   a   message </p>
<span>{count, plural, =0 {none} other {many}}</span>
<p i18n-title title="  a   {{ b }}  " i18n="A description longer than the line, which Prettier fills over lines of its own">x</p>

